From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brett-Michael Green <brett@bmgvisualtech.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:23:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mailbox: google,gs101-mbox: Add the Tensor G3
 mailbox

zuma's (Tensor G3) AP-to-APM mailbox is gs101's, as on gs201 and
Tensor G4: same registers, one interrupt and one bus clock. Document
it with gs101's compatible as the fallback.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Brett-Michael Green <brett@bmgvisualtech.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
index d1a6c6eda..559da2393 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - google,gs201-mbox
+              - google,zuma-mbox
               - google,zumapro-mbox
           - const: google,gs101-mbox
 
